sequenceDiagram
    participant MM as Media Management
    participant P as Processing + DB
    participant Q as Redis/RQ
    participant W as Worker
    Note over MM,W: Design only — all protocols not run
    MM->>MM: Commit source + pending Asset before 202
    MM->>P: Submit same asset ID (5s timeout)
    alt P unavailable
        MM->>MM: Durable periodic backoff ≤60s, alert 5min, escalate 30min
    else Job committed
        P->>Q: Enqueue current attempt after commit
        Note over P,Q: Lost entry + surviving hash: DB scan repairs membership ≤2min
        Q->>W: Deliver attempt ID
        W->>P: Conditional first claim of reserved attempt ID + 60s lease
        W->>MM: Refresh owner/revision source URL (900s)
        loop Every 15s during encode
            W->>P: Heartbeat only current processing + unexpired lease
        end
        alt Worker killed or lease lost
            Note over W: Stop/kill FFmpeg, cannot publish
            P->>P: 15s sweep marks expired attempt failed ≤5min
            MM->>P: Explicit retry ID creates one new attempt
        else Valid completion
            W->>P: Publish verified attempt outputs under live fence
        end
    end
    Note over MM,P: Cancel and Submit share guard, stale completions rejected
